## QuietCraft UI — Anti-Slop React 19 & Tailwind v4 Starter

QuietCraft UI provides temperature-matched neutral CSS token ramps (`Graphite` light/dark), a 4px spatial rhythm, hairline borders, `tabular-nums` alignment, and drop-in `AGENTS.md` guardrails for coding agents.

### What Is Included
- **Lite (Free / MIT):** CSS token variables, core KPI / Modal / Toast components, and starter `AGENTS.md` UI rules.
- **Pro Bundle (One-time fee):** 16-block SaaS workspace, pure-SVG interactive revenue chart, searchable CSV-export table, `Ctrl+K` command palette, Warm Paper & Deep Ink palettes, and standalone single-file HTML starter.

[Live Interactive Demo](https://tolga571.github.io/quietcraft-ui-lite/) · [GitHub Repository](https://github.com/tolga571/quietcraft-ui-lite) · [Pro Bundle ($3 w/ FIRST50)](https://jumpertheme.gumroad.com/l/quietcraft-ui-pro/FIRST50)
